ata-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfasob36lv/" data-dfa="dfasob36lv"></a>&nbsp;</span></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:62.67%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr427/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfaslc1faw/" data-dfa="dfaslc1faw"></a>Итого&nbsp;по разделу II (стр.490+600)</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:9.94%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr428/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfasc33oup/" data-dfa="dfasc33oup"></a><strong>770</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:13.69%; text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr429/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfasy423pw/" data-dfa="dfasy423pw"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:13.54%"><p style="text-align:center"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr430/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfasedw7vm/" data-dfa="dfasedw7vm"></a>38640</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="width:62.67%"><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr431/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfas4rqqve/" data-dfa="dfas4rqqve"></a>Всего&nbsp;по пассиву баланса (стр.480+770)</p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:9.94%"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr432/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfasi8pzo2/" data-dfa="dfasi8pzo2"></a><strong>780</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:13.69%; text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr433/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfasw89y2f/" data-dfa="dfasw89y2f"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="width:13.54%"><p style="text-align:center"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr434/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfasblmqyk/" data-dfa="dfasblmqyk"></a>96582</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr435/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfasy0ad96/" data-dfa="dfasy0ad96"></a>*) При наличии просроченной дебиторской и кредиторской задолженности их расшифровка приводится согласно приложению к Бухгалтерскому балансу.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr436/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfas3y6ep1/" data-dfa="dfas3y6ep1"></a>Достоверность указанных в данной финансовой отчетности сведений подтверждаю:</p><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:25%; vertical-align:top"><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr437/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfase4k1qt/" data-dfa="dfase4k1qt"></a>Руководитель</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:35.37%; vertical-align:top"><p style="text-align:center"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr438/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfasn9z6n5/" data-dfa="dfasn9z6n5"></a>Каримов А. В.</span></p></td><td style="width:3.37%; vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr439/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfas86ebgx/" data-dfa="dfas86ebgx"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:35.92%; vertical-align:top; text-align:center"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr440/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfaspoiui8/" data-dfa="dfaspoiui8"></a>Каримов А. В.</span></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%; vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr441/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfasxp8kny/" data-dfa="dfasxp8kny"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdTop" style="width:35.37%; vertical-align:top"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr442/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/dfasbllg29/" data-dfa="dfasbllg29"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td><td style="width:3.37%; vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/205634/bssPhr443/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/11